":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I've heard that the review of pension benefits for the elderly was also debated at that time.","jp":"高齢者への年金給付の見直しについても、当時から議論があったと聞いています。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,6,8,9,11,14,18,20,22,45,59,75,296,516,555,1017,1472,2109,2394,3550,4253,5804,7885,9154,16561],"jpTokens":[{"s":"高齢","r":"こうれい","w":2109},{"s":"者","r":"しゃ","w":45},{"s":"へ","w":59},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"年金","r":"ねんきん","w":1472},{"s":"給付","r":"きゅうふ","w":4253},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"見直し","r":"みなおし","w":2394},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"、"},{"s":"当時","r":"とうじ","w":555},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"議論","r":"ぎろん","w":516},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あっ","w":22},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"聞い","r":"きい","w":1017},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Yes, from the perspective of intergenerational fairness, we truly agonized over what constituted a reasonable judgment.","jp":"ええ、世代間の公平性という観点から、何が妥当な判断なのか、本当に悩みました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,6,8,14,16,20,21,28,32,70,106,198,289,523,1454,1885,3039,4283,4781,4940,5004,6358],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"世代","r":"せだい","w":1454},{"s":"間","r":"かん","w":198},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"公平","r":"こうへい","w":4940},{"s":"性","r":"せい","w":106},{"s":"という","w":32},{"s":"観点","r":"かんてん","w":1885},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"、"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"妥当","r":"だとう","w":4283},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"判断","r":"はんだん","w":523},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本当に","r":"ほんとうに","w":289},{"s":"悩み","r":"なやみ","w":6358},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Finally, could you offer some advice to the younger generation who aspire to work in policy?","jp":"最後に、これから政策を志す若い世代へ、何かアドバイスをいただけますか。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,14,16,59,70,305,441,548,1055,1454,2382,2693,3077,3723,5103,5203,5964,7154,16988],"jpTokens